00:06:44.750 --> 00:06:45.666
official conclusion

311
00:06:45.666 --> 00:06:46.291
can be reached.

312
00:06:46.458 --> 00:06:47.291
Thank you, Minister.

313
00:06:47.791 --> 00:06:48.291
The Olivia

314
00:06:48.333 --> 00:06:49.000
you have spoken

315
00:06:49.000 --> 00:06:50.500
as the forest's memory.

316
00:06:50.541 --> 00:06:51.083
Do you possess

317
00:06:51.083 --> 00:06:51.666
any relevant

318
00:06:51.666 --> 00:06:52.666
information or evidence

319
00:06:52.666 --> 00:06:53.083
regarding the

320
00:06:53.083 --> 00:06:54.041
cause of the fire?

321
00:06:54.375 --> 00:06:56.458
I didn't see the first spark,

322
00:06:56.666 --> 00:06:57.500
nor the hand

323
00:06:57.541 --> 00:06:58.750
that brought the flame.

324
00:06:58.791 --> 00:07:00.291
I heard only whispers

325
00:07:00.333 --> 00:07:01.625
carried by the wind,

326
00:07:01.666 --> 00:07:02.541
as one tree

327
00:07:02.583 --> 00:07:04.083
called to another.

328
00:07:04.208 --> 00:07:05.750
I heard brave voices

329
00:07:05.791 --> 00:07:07.291
shouting through the smoke.

330
00:07:07.666 --> 00:07:09.125
Firefighters risking

331
00:07:09.166 --> 00:07:10.958
their lives holding the line

332
00:07:11.000 --> 00:07:12.000
as they fought

333
00:07:12.000 --> 00:07:13.666
what could still be saved.

334
00:07:13.916 --> 00:07:15.416
Then came another voice.

335
00:07:15.458 --> 00:07:17.291
The order to withdraw;

336
00:07:17.583 --> 00:07:19.250
the flames had grown

337
00:07:19.291 --> 00:07:20.791
beyond their reach.

338
00:07:20.916 --> 00:07:21.916
The thirsty bush 

339
00:07:22.125 --> 00:07:22.958
fed them well.

340
00:07:23.666 --> 00:07:25.791
Perhaps it was an accident.

341
00:07:26.333 --> 00:07:27.958
Perhaps something darker.

342
00:07:28.000 --> 00:07:29.125
I do not know.

343
00:07:29.166 --> 00:07:31.000
But this much was clear:

344
00:07:31.083 --> 00:07:32.791
the fire was not born

345
00:07:33.250 --> 00:07:33.958
of nature alone.

346
00:07:34.458 --> 00:07:34.875
Thank you,

347
00:07:34.916 --> 00:07:35.916
The Olivia.

348
00:07:35.958 --> 00:07:36.875
You have asked this court

349
00:07:36.875 --> 00:07:37.916
for neither compensation

350
00:07:37.916 --> 00:07:39.125
nor punishment.

351
00:07:39.166 --> 00:07:40.333
In the absence of either,

352
00:07:40.375 --> 00:07:41.458
what relief do you seek?

353
00:07:41.666 --> 00:07:42.833
I asked for neither gold

354
00:07:42.875 --> 00:07:43.708
nor guilt.

355
00:07:43.750 --> 00:07:45.791
Neither of these can restore

356
00:07:45.833 --> 00:07:46.708
what was lost.

357
00:07:47.083 --> 00:07:48.125
Ancient roots,

358
00:07:48.583 --> 00:07:50.083
older than kingdoms

359
00:07:50.166 --> 00:07:51.625
became ash.

360
00:07:51.666 --> 00:07:53.166
Nests fell silent.

361
00:07:53.208 --> 00:07:54.708
Burrows emptied.

362
00:07:54.875 --> 00:07:56.750
Wings found no sky.

363
00:07:57.208 --> 00:07:58.166
Countless lives

364
00:07:58.166 --> 00:07:59.666
ended together.

365
00:07:59.708 --> 00:08:01.208
I asked this court

366
00:08:01.458 --> 00:08:02.458
to remember them.

367
00:08:02.916 --> 00:08:04.125
And to ask:

368
00:08:04.416 --> 00:08:05.958
whether the wisdom of those

369
00:08:06.000 --> 00:08:08.208
who lived with the forest

370
00:08:08.291 --> 00:08:09.875
was slowly replaced

371
00:08:09.916 --> 00:08:11.458
by rules written

372
00:08:11.500 --> 00:08:13.000
far from the soil.

373
00:08:13.333 --> 00:08:15.375
I ask that every law,

374
00:08:15.750 --> 00:08:17.250
every regulation,

375
00:08:17.625 --> 00:08:19.125
every requirement

376
00:08:19.333 --> 00:08:20.375
be examined.

377
00:08:20.916 --> 00:08:22.750
Not only for what it intended,

378
00:08:22.875 --> 00:08:24.416
but for what it prevented.

379
00:08:25.041 --> 00:08:25.916
If these forests

380
00:08:25.916 --> 00:08:27.458
were made less resilient

381
00:08:27.541 --> 00:08:28.416
by the very hands

382
00:08:28.416 --> 00:08:29.958
that sought to protect them,

383
00:08:30.333 --> 00:08:31.750
then let those hands

384
00:08:31.791 --> 00:08:33.208
have the wisdom

385
00:08:33.250 --> 00:08:34.541
to begin again,

386
00:08:34.583 --> 00:08:36.083
as will the forest.

387
00:08:36.166 --> 00:08:36.583
Thank you,

388
00:08:36.583 --> 00:08:37.125
The Olivia.

389
00:08:37.625 --> 00:08:38.541
Minister Burnbright

390
00:08:38.541 --> 00:08:39.166
before this court

391
00:08:39.208 --> 00:08:40.291
renders its opinion,

392
00:08:40.333 --> 00:08:40.958
do you have any

393
00:08:40.958 --> 00:08:41.750
final remarks?

394
00:08:41.958 --> 00:08:43.000
Thank you, Your Honor.

395
00:08:43.041 --> 00:08:44.000
The Ministry accepts

396
00:08:44.000 --> 00:08:45.000
that no legislative

397
00:08:45.000 --> 00:08:46.791
framework is beyond review.

398
00:08:46.916 --> 00:08:48.000
Existing law provides

399
00:08:48.000 --> 00:08:49.666
a structured process through

400
00:08:49.708 --> 00:08:50.958
which proposed amendments

401
00:08:50.958 --> 00:08:52.666
may be submitted, evaluated,

402
00:08:52.708 --> 00:08:54.125
and, where appropriate, 

403
00:08:54.125 --> 00:08:55.125
adopted.

404
00:08:55.416 --> 00:08:56.958
If change is justified,

405
00:08:57.000 --> 00:08:58.083
the law already provides

406
00:08:58.083 --> 00:08:59.000
the means to achieve it.

407
00:08:59.166 --> 00:09:00.000
The court has heard

408
00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:00.333
two very

409
00:09:00.333 --> 00:09:01.625
different perspectives.

410
00:09:01.666 --> 00:09:02.708
The Olivia has spoken

411
00:09:02.708 --> 00:09:03.166
from memory

412
00:09:03.166 --> 00:09:04.250
and stewardship.

413
00:09:04.291 --> 00:09:05.291
Minister Burnbright

414
00:09:05.291 --> 00:09:06.125
has spoken for law

415
00:09:06.125 --> 00:09:07.208
and process.

416
00:09:07.250 --> 00:09:07.666
The court

417
00:09:07.666 --> 00:09:08.500
finds no evidence

418
00:09:08.500 --> 00:09:09.166
that the Ministry

419
00:09:09.166 --> 00:09:10.666
acted with malice, nor

420
00:09:10.708 --> 00:09:11.625
that regulation alone

421
00:09:11.625 --> 00:09:12.791
caused these fires.

422
00:09:12.791 --> 00:09:13.166
However,

423
00:09:13.166 --> 00:09:14.083
the evidence persuades

424
00:09:14.083 --> 00:09:14.458
this court

425
00:09:14.458 --> 00:09:15.208
that the relationship

426
00:09:15.208 --> 00:09:16.375
between rural communities

427
00:09:16.375 --> 00:09:17.666
and the forest has over

428
00:09:17.666 --> 00:09:18.083
time become

429
00:09:18.083 --> 00:09:19.041
increasingly displaced

430
00:09:19.041 --> 00:09:20.666
by administrative process,

431
00:09:20.750 --> 00:09:22.208
whether by complexity, cost,

432
00:09:22.250 --> 00:09:24.000
uncertainty or fragmentation.

433
00:09:24.041 --> 00:09:24.916
The cumulative effect

434
00:09:24.916 --> 00:09:25.625
has been to reduce

435
00:09:25.625 --> 00:09:26.333
the participation

436
00:09:26.333 --> 00:09:27.250
of those who once cared

437
00:09:27.250 --> 00:09:28.166
for these lands as part

438
00:09:28.166 --> 00:09:29.208
of everyday life.

439
00:09:30.166 --> 00:09:31.791
Laws should protect forests.

440
00:09:31.833 --> 00:09:32.791
They should not discourage

441
00:09:32.791 --> 00:09:33.625
the people who have long 

442
00:09:33.625 --> 00:09:34.500
helped protect them.

443
00:09:34.916 --> 00:09:36.041
Accordingly, the court orders

444
00:09:36.041 --> 00:09:36.541
the Ministry

445
00:09:36.541 --> 00:09:37.416
to immediately commence

446
00:09:37.416 --> 00:09:38.333
a comprehensive review

447
00:09:38.333 --> 00:09:39.041
of the legislative

448
00:09:39.041 --> 00:09:40.125
and regulatory framework

449
00:09:40.125 --> 00:09:41.000
governing the stewardship

450
00:09:41.000 --> 00:09:42.541
of protected forest lands.

451
00:09:42.708 --> 00:09:43.708
The Ministry shall convene

452
00:09:43.708 --> 00:09:44.250
a consortium

453
00:09:44.250 --> 00:09:45.000
of representatives

454
00:09:45.000 --> 00:09:45.250
from the

455
00:09:45.250 --> 00:09:46.500
agricultural, forestry,

456
00:09:46.500 --> 00:09:47.958
and firefighting sectors,

457
00:09:48.000 --> 00:09:49.000
together with delegates

458
00:09:49.000 --> 00:09:49.750
from the communities

459
00:09:49.750 --> 00:09:50.625
surrounding the protected

460
00:09:50.625 --> 00:09:52.041
lands, and shall present

461
00:09:52.083 --> 00:09:53.000
revised legislation

462
00:09:53.000 --> 00:09:53.625
for enactment

463
00:09:53.625 --> 00:09:55.166
before the next fire season.

464
00:09:55.375 --> 00:09:56.416
Finally, the court offers

465
00:09:56.416 --> 00:09:57.708
one recommendation.

466
00:09:57.750 --> 00:09:58.625
Minister Burnbright,

467
00:09:58.666 --> 00:09:59.208
I encourage

468
00:09:59.208 --> 00:09:59.875
you and your staff

469
00:09:59.875 --> 00:10:00.375
to spend time

470
00:10:00.375 --> 00:10:01.291
restoring the forests

471
00:10:01.291 --> 00:10:02.250
affected by these fires

472
00:10:02.250 --> 00:10:02.875
while this review

473
00:10:02.875 --> 00:10:03.791
is underway.

474
00:10:03.833 --> 00:10:04.458
Not because the

475
00:10:04.458 --> 00:10:05.750
law requires it,

476
00:10:05.791 --> 00:10:06.625
but because no amount

477
00:10:06.625 --> 00:10:07.666
of reading about a forest

478
00:10:07.666 --> 00:10:08.291
will ever equal

479
00:10:08.291 --> 00:10:09.125
walking through one.

480
00:10:09.291 --> 00:10:10.791
I'd say this case needed

481
00:10:10.791 --> 00:10:11.916
a little less red tape

482
00:10:11.916 --> 00:10:13.666
and a few more green shoots.

483
00:10:13.833 --> 00:10:15.000
Here's hoping the next draft

484
00:10:15.000 --> 00:10:15.250
grows

485
00:10:15.250 --> 00:10:16.541
better than the last one.

486
00:10:16.541 --> 00:10:17.041
Well said,

487
00:10:17.083 --> 00:10:17.875
Bailiff Bottie.

488
00:10:18.166 --> 00:10:19.208
The law, like the forest

489
00:10:19.208 --> 00:10:20.000
it serves,

490
00:10:20.000 --> 00:10:20.541
must remain

491
00:10:20.541 --> 00:10:21.958
capable of growth.

492
00:10:22.000 --> 00:10:23.500
May the forests recover.

493
00:10:23.708 --> 00:10:24.250
May the people

494
00:10:24.250 --> 00:10:25.625
who care for them return,

495
00:10:25.625 --> 00:10:27.083
and may future generations

496
00:10:27.125 --> 00:10:28.208
inherit both healthier

497
00:10:28.208 --> 00:10:28.625
woodlands

498
00:10:28.625 --> 00:10:30.166
and wiser stewardship.

499
00:10:30.375 --> 00:10:31.500
This court is adjourned.

500
